  "readme": {
    "available": true,
    "excerpt": "Since DSH 0.1.5 a stored session is migrated through v0 → v1 → v2 → v3 on open, and every step is validated strictly. Fields that older builds wrote empty are rejected by the migration chain, surfacing as \"history unavailable\" for that session. This tool fixes exactly those logs."
  },
